[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165747490","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3165747490","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3165747490,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68sXki","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T21:21:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T21:21:45Z","body":"A little bit of feature creep, but will drafting and undrafting force the actions to run again?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165747490/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165995320","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3165995320","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3165995320,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68tUE4","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T22:11:21Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T22:16:17Z","body":"This feels like pretty unexpected behavior to me, I would expect draft PRs to work just fine, draft status should IMO be about *reviews* not CI, to ensure things work and are ready for review\r\n\r\nThere's no substitute for being properly deliberate and intentional about your pushes, if anything it'd be nice to be able to handle too many rapid pushes in a row and delay running if a push happens within a certain window of a previous one, delaying for a bit after that to not start five CI runs that just run a few seconds into building all the platforms\r\n\r\nI want my draft PRs to run CI and this would force me to make my PRs non-drafts to accomplish that properly (since not all CI features work correctly on forks at least the last time I checked), which would defeat the main goal namely not triggering requests for reviews","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3165995320/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166039984","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3166039984","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3166039984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68te-w","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T22:37:12Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T22:37:12Z","body":"> A little bit of feature creep, but will drafting and undrafting force the actions to run again?\r\n\r\nIndeed it would! Similarly, an in-progress action would stop when becoming a draft\r\n\r\n> There's no substitute for being properly deliberate and intentional about your pushes, if anything it'd be nice to be able to handle too many rapid pushes in a row and delay running if a push happens within a certain window of a previous one, delaying for a bit after that to not start five CI runs that just run a few seconds into building all the platforms\r\n\r\nHmm, that'd definitely be a lot trickier. We can't exactly control user intent, and I don't know if there's metadata for determining a previous run. \r\n\r\n> I want my draft PRs to run CI and this would force me to make my PRs non-drafts to accomplish that properly (since not all CI features work correctly on forks at least the last time I checked), which would defeat the main goal namely not triggering requests for reviews\r\n\r\nIf there's CI inconsistencies with forks, that should absolutely be addressed. Do you have any specific examples in mind?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166039984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166075059","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3166075059","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3166075059,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68tniz","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-07T22:59:39Z","updated_at":"2025-08-07T22:59:39Z","body":"At least a few months ago the static checks don't work correctly on forks, failing to find formatting and spelling errors, this has been the case for years as far as I recall\r\n\r\nI've only seen a handful of people who don't expect CI to run on drafts, and the vast majority of inexperienced users don't use drafts, so this won't prevent running in the case of experienced users pushing ten times in an hour\r\n\r\nI'd say if someone don't want CI to run they should use the proper tools for it instead, and we should document that better, rather than breaking expectations and hurting usability ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3166075059/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167012525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3167012525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3167012525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68xMat","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T08:31:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T08:31:50Z","body":"That's a strange and counterintuitive thing to do, and won't help with push spam. New contributors who are not familiar with workflow and pushing too much are unlikely to set PR to draft in the first place. And if you specifically do not want PR to run actions, it's always possible to add `[skip ci]`, `[ci skip]`, `[no ci]`, `[skip actions]` to the commit name.\r\n\r\nDraft only indicate it's not ready to merge, artifacts can be still useful for testing. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167012525/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167057697","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3167057697","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3167057697,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc68xXch","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T08:47:51Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T08:50:42Z","body":"For CI that cannot work on forks you have some of the static checks because there's no branch base to check against, or rather it only works for very specific conditions, namely a push that's non `--force`d, which essentially means very few if any pushes to a contribution branch except for the initial commit or if the changes are done linearly instead up rewriting, so generally the checks that depend on changed files are nearly useless in forks:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/80a219a58ad050519a8a51b76f7f43e15accc577/.github/workflows/static_checks.yml#L27","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3167057697/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168713858","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3168713858","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3168713858,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683ryC","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:01:50Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:01:50Z","body":"In any case, this doesn't look like it'll have the desired effect. I'll look into a frequency blocker instead, though I can't promise that anything will come from it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168713858/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168717357","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109407#issuecomment-3168717357","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109407","id":3168717357,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc683sot","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T17:03:24Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T17:03:24Z","body":"I'll look into documenting the ways to prevent running CI more clearly to help people use that when needed (can even add it to the PR template comment)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3168717357/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]